Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------

1. Dagstuhl ChoirSet (DCS) v1.2.3, CC BY-NC 4.0 (non-commercial use, with attribution).
   https://zenodo.org/records/4618287, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.4618287
   S. Rosenzweig, H. Cuesta, C. Weiss, F. Scherbaum, E. Gomez, M. Mueller, "Dagstuhl ChoirSet: A Multitrack
   Dataset for MIR Research on Choral Singing," TISMIR 3(1):98-110, 2020. https://doi.org/10.5334/tismir.48
   Files derived from it (changed: features extracted, notes re-timed or combined with Duet's output):
     live/cache/dcs_LI_FullChoir_S1_DYN_Take01.json, .npz, _notes.csv   (pitch track and aligned notes, one take)
     live/demo/dcs_locus_iste_S1_take02.mid
     media/demo/tebe_poem_S1_take02*.mid                               (melody track = DCS aligned notes)
     media/data/frozen_notes.json                                       (per-note timing errors; also ECD)
     media/figures/fig_b_losses_by_level_tebe_poem.*, fig_c_timeline_real_take.*
     data/figures/dcs_example_LI_QuartetA_Take01.png, dcs_take_to_take_timing.png
     data/sanity/*, data/scripts/selections/dcs_*                       (inventory, listings, statistics)
     eval/results/*, eval/figures/*                                     (per-take and pooled statistics)
   No DCS audio is committed. The demo wav files that contain DCS audio (media/demo/tebe_poem_*.wav) are
   git-ignored and are for course presentations only (media/demo/CREDITS.md).

2. ESMUC Choir Dataset (ECD) v1.0.0, CC BY 4.0.
   https://zenodo.org/records/5848990, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.5848990
   H. Cuesta, E. Gomez, ESMUC Choir Dataset v1.0.0, Zenodo, 2022.
   Used for: per-take and per-note timing statistics in eval/results/, media/data/frozen_notes.json,
   data/sanity/, data/figures/ecd_example_DG_take1.png, media/figures/fig_a_*, fig_b_*_seele_christi.*, fig_d_*.
   No ECD audio and no score is committed.

3. vocadito, CC BY 4.0. https://zenodo.org/records/5578807
