   arXiv:2110.05580, 2021. Used for the annotation-agreement statistics (data/sanity/,
   data/figures/human_asynchrony_vs_annotator_agreement.png). No vocadito audio is committed.

4. Bach chorales from the music21 corpus (music21 10.5.0; software BSD-3-Clause; corpus terms in
